    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/36f3530ad3748d4f9233bbc3dd9155a2.poster.avif?t=1755650516\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/36f3530ad3748d4f9233bbc3dd9155a2.webm?t=1755650516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/36f3530ad3748d4f9233bbc3dd9155a2.mp4?t=1755650516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has a connection to their electronics\u2026 but not everyone has a romantic one. Love Surge! is a visual novel, comedy dating sim, where you can romance human versions of your appliances: Noki (cell phone), Lotte (coffee machine), and Celci (thermostat). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When going on dates, the gameplay merges the visual novel text with card game mechanics, to rack up point combos and simulate deeper conversations! This game combines the genres of dating sim, visual novel, and deck builder for one epic adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/734bdb8677ca430b1493b4f3a72d6c95.poster.avif?t=1755650516\" width=622 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/734bdb8677ca430b1493b4f3a72d6c95.webm?t=1755650516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/734bdb8677ca430b1493b4f3a72d6c95.mp4?t=1755650516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celci</strong> (Thermostat)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Likes: <i>Long Walks, Cool Bugs, Programming</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dislikes: <i>Crowds, Other People</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noki</strong> (Cell Phone)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Likes: <i>Photography, Gardening, \u201cHarmless\u201d Pranks</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dislikes: <i>Separation</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lotte</strong> (Coffee Machine)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Likes: <i>Live Music, Sewing &amp; Fashion, Helping Friends</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dislikes: <i>Coffee</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/9e3d3bbb375fac9ca7a68eadd14332a2.poster.avif?t=1755650516\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/9e3d3bbb375fac9ca7a68eadd14332a2.webm?t=1755650516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/9e3d3bbb375fac9ca7a68eadd14332a2.mp4?t=1755650516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Explore the town to increase your stats and build up your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Engage in conversations with your appliances (dates).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Interact in your world and theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Feel the spark in: Love Surge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/c98603dec619d81293bda0daca291391.poster.avif?t=1755650516\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/c98603dec619d81293bda0daca291391.webm?t=1755650516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/c98603dec619d81293bda0daca291391.mp4?t=1755650516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck builder, dating sim, and visual novel all wrapped into one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different romanceable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has two different endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/cf22ac6d4904bbf089c0194a9cc53b66.poster.avif?t=1755650516\" width=714 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/cf22ac6d4904bbf089c0194a9cc53b66.webm?t=1755650516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/cf22ac6d4904bbf089c0194a9cc53b66.mp4?t=1755650516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
